现在设计 cp_ui_main.c 的调试菜单改动。

**改动设计**（cp_ui_main.c main 循环）：

当前循环：
```c
char line[16];  // 太小
...
if (fgets(line, sizeof(line), stdin) == NULL) { pause(); continue; }
s = line;
while (*s == ' ' || *s == '\t') s++;
if (strncmp(s, "quit", 4) == 0 || strncmp(s, "exit", 4) == 0 || strncmp(s, "q", 1) == 0) break;
```

问题：`strncmp(s, "q", 1) == 0` 会把任何以 q 开头的词当 quit（比如将来 "query"）。但当前只认 quit/exit/q，OK。

我改成：
```c
char line[256];
char cmd[32];
int n = 0;
...
if (fgets(line, sizeof(line), stdin) == NULL) { pause(); continue; }
// trim leading spaces
s = line;
while (*s==' '||*s=='\t') s++;
// strip trailing newline/CR
size_t l = strlen(s);
while (l && (s[l-1]=='\n'||s[l-1]=='\r')) s[--l]=0;

if (sscanf(s, "%31s%n", cmd, &n) != 1) continue;  // empty
const char *arg = s + n;
while (*arg==' '||*arg=='\t') arg++;

if (strcmp(cmd,"quit")==0 || strcmp(cmd,"exit")==0 || strcmp(cmd,"q")==0) break;
else if (strcmp(cmd,"show")==0 || strcmp(cmd,"chat")==0) lvgl_ui_channel_show();
else if (strcmp(cmd,"page")==0) lvgl_ui_channel_set_page(atoi(arg));
else if (strcmp(cmd,"pet")==0) lvgl_ui_channel_set_pet_state(atoi(arg));
else if (strcmp(cmd,"ptt")==0) lvgl_ui_channel_set_ptt(atoi(arg));
else if (strcmp(cmd,"say")==0 && *arg) lvgl_ui_channel_send(arg);
else if (strcmp(cmd,"sayc")==0) { uint32_t c=strtoul(arg,&e,0); ... send_ex(text, c); }
else if (strcmp(cmd,"user")==0 && *arg) lvgl_ui_channel_send_user(arg);
else if (strcmp(cmd,"demo")==0) run_demo();
else if (strcmp(cmd,"help")==0) print_menu();
